1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
THE LIVING INTERVAL — Gurdjieff's Ray of Creation, as recorded by P. D. Ouspensky.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:22,000
ONE SELECTED RAY — Seven successive world orders—not a beam of physical light.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:38,000
THE LAW OF THREE — Active, passive and neutralizing forces meet: three roles in every phenomenon.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:52,000
ORDERS OF LAWS — The numbers count governing orders of forces, not named laboratory rules.

5
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:05,000
A DEEPENING ORDER — Lower worlds bear more laws; the teaching calls their life more mechanical.

6
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:19,000
THE PLANETARY WORLD — A selected world of planets belongs to the larger order.

7
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:33,000
THE LAW OF SEVEN — The cosmic octave has an interval between the planets and Earth.

8
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:46,000
THE LIVING INTERMEDIARY — Organic life fills that interval and receives planetary influences.

9
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:59,000
THE SENSITIVE FILM — Plants, animals and people form Earth’s living organ of perception.

10
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:12,000
DIFFERENT LIVING RECEIVERS — Grassland and a human gathering receive different influences, in this account.

11
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:24,000
RECEPTION AND MEDIATION — Influence reaches life; a distinct living response moves inward to Earth.

12
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:36,000
WHAT IS BEING TRANSMITTED? — The source calls these planetary influences; their physical nature is unspecified.

13
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:50,000
RADIATION OUTWARD — Life also radiates differently toward Sun, planets and Moon.

14
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:56,000
ONE CONNECTED COSMOLOGY — Hierarchy, interval, living mediation and reciprocal radiations belong together.
